@zgabi thanks for confirming it's still happening — that led us to the real root cause! 🔍

In #75 you discovered that you run mRemoteNG from `C:\Program Files\` which is **read-only**. That's exactly the problem — the settings provider was trying to write the XML settings file next to the exe, failing silently, and losing all your preferences on every restart.

